{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_05363","headline":"送武进郑明府 · 徐坚","name":"送武进郑明府","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"弦歌试宰日，城阙赏心违。\n北谢苍龙去，南随黄鹄飞。\n夏云海中出，吴山江上微。\n甿谣岂云远，从此庆缁衣。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"徐坚","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_05363.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_05363","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}